[0.093, "o", "\r\n── Corporate boot — make-corporate-profile with memory/sqlite fallback\r\n   look at: kind, tenant, tenant-scoped ids; Clack /healthz /readyz 200; unauthenticated / → 302\r\n"]
[0.018, "o", "\r\n── Factory returned a corporate profile (no live Postgres)\r\n   corporate-profile-p: T\r\n   profile-kind: :CORPORATE\r\n   tenant: \"acme\"\r\n   look at: :CORPORATE kind and tenant \"acme\" — memory journal/session/rag, not a DSN\r\n\r\n── Tenant-scoped identifiers\r\n   tenant-task-id echo: \"tenant/acme/domain/echo\"\r\n   tenant-corpus-name docs: \"tenant/acme/corpus/docs\"\r\n   current-tenant: \"acme\"\r\n"]
[0.027, "o", "\r\n── make-expert-app Clack env (no session cookie)\r\n   GET /healthz status: 200\r\n   GET /readyz status: 200\r\n   GET / status: 302\r\n   GET / Location: \"/login\"\r\n   look at: /healthz and /readyz stay unauthenticated (C4). GET / is a 302 to /login.\r\n\r\n── Corporate-boot done. Reviewer: kind/tenant scoped; probes 200; / challenges.\r\n"]
